  "sourcePropertiesProposedNotTested": [
    "Two fixed capture registry cells; exact descriptor and current permit reference checks; one-shot Execute invokes the real synchronous broker",
    "Free requires actual broker-call return plus exact successful broker commit; CommitObserved is cleared on Free",
    "Single commit call across all eight broker slots, outside the coordinator gate; prepaid ERROR selection remains broker2a-only",
    "Shared lifetime cap of 550 prepare-plus-commit actions, including empty/invalid/held attempts if room; no increment or port IO on cap refusal",
    "Fresh supplied elapsed argument on each prepare and commit; nonnegative, nondecreasing, deadline refusal at 55000; no internal clock",
    "Sticky first-cause HOLD on the real broker, then separate CaptureHeld and EvidenceIncomplete Mark calls; observed external broker HOLD/signals adopted",
    "No new payload buffer, budget, framing, growing queue, dispatch, cancellation, joining, ACK, finalizer, Closed or release path"
  ],
